<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria cbank cuts main interest rate to 6.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria cbank cuts main interest rate to 6.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank said on Wednesday it cut the annual main interest rate to 6.96 percent from 9.76 percent, effective from Monday.</p>
</text>
